      "name": "Custom Liquid - Subscriptions",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"custom-subscription-section\">\n  <div class=\"image-container\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2656/6094/files/Happy_Smiles-Big_Savings.webp?v=1763703089\" alt=\"Subscription Image\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <h2><em>Happy</em> Smiles, <br>Big Savings!</br></h2>\n    <p>With Boka subscriptions, you get the best in oral care conveniently delivered right to your door when you need it.</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"icon-text-container\">\n      <div class=\"icon-text\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2656/6094/files/Icon_1.webp?v=1763703368=\"Save 10%\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span>Save 10% on every order</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"icon-text\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2656/6094/files/Icon_2.webp?v=1763703368\" alt=\"Subscriber Rewards\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span>Enjoy exclusive subscriber rewards </span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"icon-text\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2656/6094/files/Icon_3.webp?v=1763703368\" alt=\"Manage Subscription\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span>Easily swap products, pause, or cancel anytime</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/subscription-favs\" class=\"subscribe-btn\">SUBSCRIBE & SAVE</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.custom-subscription-section {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    padding: 70px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    flex-direction: row-reverse;\n}\n\n.content {\n    max-width: 50%;\n    padding-left: 10px;\n}\n\n.image-container {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    max-width: 50%;\n    margin-left: 40px;\n}\n\n.image-container img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    display: block;\n}\n\n.content h2 {\n    color: #000000;\n    font-size: 48px;\n    font-weight: regular;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.content p {\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.icon-text-container {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 40px;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n.icon-text {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    max-width: 180px;\n}\n\n.icon-text img {\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n}\n\n.icon-text span {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: #333;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.subscribe-btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background-color: #000000 !important; \n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    padding: 10px 24px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    text-align: center;\n    letter-spacing: 1.2px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .custom-subscription-section {\n        flex-direction: column; \n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 25px;\n    }\n    .image-container {\n        order: -1;\n        max-width: 100%;\n        margin-left: 0; \n    }\n    .content {\n        max-width: 100%;\n        padding-left: 0;\n    }\n\n    .icon-text-container {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: row;\n        justify-content: center;\n        flex-wrap: nowrap;\n        gap: 10px;\n    }\n    \n    .icon-text {\n        max-width: 120px;\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .content h2 {\n        font-size: 32px;\n    }\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 769px) {\n    .image-container {\n        margin-left: 40px;\n    }\n}\n</style>",
