      "settings": {
        "title": "<p><strong>Say hello</strong><em><strong> </strong></em><strong>to n-Ha toothpaste.</strong></p>",
        "heading_alignment": "center",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "description": "<p>Hydroxyapatite is the primary foundation of teeth and bones. Known for its long-standing use in oral care, it's been studied for decades in relation to enamel. Our n-Ha toothpaste features this ingredient and comes in a variety of flavors everyone can enjoy.</p>",
