    "collapsible_content_HXMWKe": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_ETMVg6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is Boka?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Boka is a modern oral care brand focused on strengthening teeth and supporting long-term oral health. We create fluoride-free toothpaste and mouthwash made with nano-hydroxyapatite, a biomimetic mineral that mimics tooth enamel. Boka products are non-toxic when used as directed, gentle, and designed for daily use by adults and kids alike.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rbiVL6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Boka toothpaste fluoride-free?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. All Boka toothpaste is fluoride-free and formulated with nano-hydroxyapatite to support oral care.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_LTNXLJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Nano-Hydroxyapatite?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>n-Ha is a breakthrough material inspired by nature and backed by science. It's a biomimetic mineral form of the same ingredient that naturally makes up 97% of your enamel and 70% of your dentin. n-Ha has been the subject of significant research for decades with a wide variety of potential benefits across dentistry and oral care.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_kNkxzc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What products does Boka sell?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Boka offers a complete lineup of oral care essentials, including whitening powder, fluoride-free toothpaste and mouthwash, travel-size toothpaste for life on the go, and kid-friendly formulas. Our products are available as one-time purchases or convenient subscriptions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_F8q9F7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who Boka Is For?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Boka is made for people who want effective oral care without harsh ingredients. Our products are ideal for:</p><ul><li>Anyone looking for fluoride-free toothpaste<br/></li><li>People with sensitive teeth or enamel concerns<br/></li><li>Families shopping for safe oral care for kids<br/></li><li>Those avoiding harsh ingredients<br/></li><li>Customers who prefer convenient, subscription-based oral care</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_dbzgDg": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can kids use Boka toothpaste?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Boka offers gentle formulas designed for both adults and <a href=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids\" title=\"https://www.boka.com/collections/kids\">kids</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
